w, https:\/\/masterbadminton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/InOut-Boundaries-Doubles-v4-1024x728.png 1024w, https:\/\/masterbadminton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/InOut-Boundaries-Doubles-v4-768x546.png 768w, https:\/\/masterbadminton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/InOut-Boundaries-Doubles-v4-18x12.png 18w, https:\/\/masterbadminton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/InOut-Boundaries-Doubles-v4-640x455.png 640w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 557px) 100vw, 557px\" \/><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>\u5f53\u7fbd\u6bdb\u7403\u6389\u843d\u5728\u573a\u5730\u5185\u5916\u533a\u57df\u7684\u5206\u754c\u7ebf\u4e0a\u65f6\u4f1a\u53d1\u751f\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f<\/p>\n<p class=\"translation-block\">\u6211\u53d1\u73b0\u521d\u5b66\u8005\u4e2d\u975e\u5e38\u666e\u904d\u6709\u8fd9\u4e2a\u95ee\u9898\u3002\u5982\u679c\u53d1\u751f\u8fd9\u79cd\u60c5\u51b5\uff0c\u7fbd\u6bdb\u7403\u5c06\u88ab\u89c6\u4e3a\u843d\u5728\u573a\u5730\u5185\u90e8.<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18.6px; color: #ff3300;\"><b>5. \u53d1\u7403\u548c\u63a5\u53d1\u7403 - \u5e94\u7ad9\u5728\u54ea\u91cc\uff1f&nbsp;<\/b><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u53d1\u7403\u548c\u63a5\u7403\u65f6\u6211\u5e94\u8be5\u7ad9\u5728\u54ea\u91cc\uff1f\u53d1\u7403\u65f6\uff0c\u7ad9\u5728\u53d1\u7403\u7bb1\u5185\uff1b\u63a5\u6536\u65f6\uff0c\u7ad9\u5728\u63a5\u6536\u5668\u7684\u76d2\u5b50\u5185\u3002<\/p>\n<p>\u4f8b\u5982\u5728\u5355\u6253\u6bd4\u8d5b\u4e2d...<\/p>\n<p><b>\u53d1\u7403\u533a<\/b><\/p>\n<div class=\"ImageBlock ImageBlockCenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-3267\" src=\"http:\/\/masterbadminton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/Serving-and-Receiving-Service.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"553\" height=\"393\" srcset=\"https:\/\/masterbadminton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/Serving-and-Receiving-Service.png 1500w, https:\/\/masterbadminton.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/Serving-and-Receiving-Service-300x213.png 300w, https:\/\/masterbadminton.com\/wp-content\/upload